{
  "an10.52:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 10.52 ",
  "an10.52:0.2": "6. Sacittavagga ",
  "an10.52:0.3": "Sāriputtasutta ",
  "an10.52:1.1": "Tatra kho āyasmā sāriputto bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "an10.52:1.2": "“āvuso bhikkhave”ti. ",
  "an10.52:1.3": "“Āvuso”ti kho te bhikkhū āyasmato sāriputtassa paccassosuṁ. ",
  "an10.52:1.4": "Āyasmā sāriputto etadavoca: ",
  "an10.52:2.1": "“No ce, āvuso, bhikkhu paracittapariyāyakusalo hoti, atha ‘sacittapariyāyakusalo bhavissāmī’ti—",
  "an10.52:2.2": "evañhi vo, āvuso, sikkhitabbaṁ. ",
  "an10.52:3.1": "Kathañcāvuso, bhikkhu sacittapariyāyakusalo hoti? ",
  "an10.52:3.2": "Seyyathāpi, āvuso, itthī vā puriso vā daharo yuvā maṇḍanakajātiko ādāse vā parisuddhe pariyodāte acche vā udapatte sakaṁ mukhanimittaṁ paccavekkhamāno sace tattha passati rajaṁ vā aṅgaṇaṁ vā, tasseva rajassa vā aṅgaṇassa vā pahānāya vāyamati. ",
  "an10.52:3.3": "No ce tattha passati rajaṁ vā aṅgaṇaṁ vā, tenevattamano hoti paripuṇṇasaṅkappo: ",
  "an10.52:3.4": "‘lābhā vata me, parisuddhaṁ vata me’ti. ",
  "an10.52:4.1": "Evamevaṁ kho, āvuso, bhikkhuno paccavekkhaṇā bahukārā hoti kusalesu dhammesu: ",
  "an10.52:4.2": "‘abhijjhālu nu kho bahulaṁ viharāmi, anabhijjhālu nu kho bahulaṁ viharāmi, byāpannacitto nu kho bahulaṁ viharāmi, abyāpannacitto nu kho bahulaṁ viharāmi, thinamiddhapariyuṭṭhito nu kho bahulaṁ viharāmi, vigatathinamiddho nu kho bahulaṁ viharāmi, udd